<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese bomber activity near the Philippine coast and a Chinese plane in the West Philippine Sea continue, while the Armed Forces observed 48 Chinese Coast Guard and PLA Navy vessels across four key features, more than double the prior count. The Philippine Coast Guard commissioned three locally built survey ships and three new vessels, including BRP Patag, BRP Pag-asa and BRP Kalikasan, alongside US patrol boats. Joint naval exercises were held with France in the Sulu Sea and a partnership with Japan supplied five new Coast Guard vessels. The conflict still records 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNM3BKZjVGdVFVSXhQMl84aWtlWXV3Y3hObmZhYkl2RENCUGZ0blRtcDBnTlM0VmRtUWh4SHBCTlFfQXpZSHoyNVF5SnRXR1FWemVSRXNHUDJPdHlkMGo0aHpQUFJhOFJjZ25wWE1ENmZuVkdKWGdnSUxHSW1fYzFmZ2VKT3h3Vjhpa0ZCYXFCZk5iRy1XRWpxY1pRb1YxeTNUbF9lYVhpbVg4c0ZpRWFfb1N5TnZaOV9JNEwzV1VlVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine Canadian Inquirer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE9LeWE5RWJlcVNGc19Va05NeUsxbWJnOGl5VDFfMGJiUGRPVk9vVWVBbUx6Z0JJeF8tcldjZG92UHoweFRDVTVaa0s1RFdPc1BWbmNVMDlaSlBQSzR3anBsaWtpem1LYkFLdVh1QlJNUjZiRVNX?oc=5&quot;&gt;astig.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABS-CBN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOZUhKRkFzRjN2d1RMN3RpUng5Z24ySDB0UC1CcHRnRDlta0Z6ZDdaSHQxWDhPVGx5THpmb1lWem9GbHlyUWxrWXJ1cWFUcWhveTlOTVFCZWswZFhzRm1zcURlRUpaSnZIYmJnSUxScUs4QThxT